{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9dcb9cf5-845d-4776-b627-019a233e330c",
    "name": "Quipu Instance Manager",
    "description": "Complete REST API collection for the Quipu Instance Manager microservice (port 3035). Manages the lifecycle of per-tenant knowledge-graph instances: switching the active fabric's knowledge graph online, starting transient/mind/ontology graph instances, and dumping current graph data. Single controller: GraphInstanceController, base path /graph-instance.\n\nCollection variables:\n- {{baseUrl}}  — default http://localhost:3035\n- {{token}}    — bearer JWT sent as Authorization header; decoded server-side to populate the User-Id request attribute used by /start-kg\n- {{tenantId}} — tenant identifier (X-Tenant-ID header, required on every endpoint)\n\nNotes:\n- No request bodies anywhere — all inputs are query params (fabricName, activeFabricName) or headers (X-Tenant-ID).\n- No versioned media types are declared on this controller (plain application/json).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "56383100",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/56383100-9dcb9cf5-845d-4776-b627-019a233e330c?source=collection_link"
  },
